      en: ["Primary gateway and ferry terminal for the island of Sainte-Marie.", "Located at the mouth of the Marimbona River on the east coast.", "A major collection point for cloves, vanilla, and lychee fruit.", "Strategic stop along the RN5 coastal highway.", "Traditional heartland of the Betsimisaraka ethnic group.", "Key economic driver for the Analanjirofo regional trade."],
